+# N1 v2 Canon calibration pack report
+
+## Outcome
+
+The deterministic six-sheet A4 calibration pack is complete at `research/n1_v2/calibration_pack/`. Its manifest uses `nishan.n1-pack/v2`, pack ID `n1-calibration-v2`, and split `calibration`.
+
+- Manifest SHA-256: `13d23a26a04aec12dec2f37e23eeed12e250d9385fc2c7a1c9ed237702e0a378`
+- Transferable size: 8.2 MiB, 26 files including the manifest
+- Build peak RSS: 326,804 KiB
+- Physical status: pending Canon G2020 prints and 12 original POCO camera files
+
+| Sheet | Role | PDF SHA-256 |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| A0 | historical source control, cal-a | `cc9719a4e62e26742d2bc312eb34ba46c3ac04d620f1cf5f9f05569f198817a5` |
