+
+Follow `research/n1_v2/PRINTING.md` or the copy inside the pack. Print one named file at a time, then pencil only the sheet ID on its back because A0/A1 and B0/B1 intentionally look alike. Use Canon G2020, A4 plain paper, actual size/100%, borderless off, Fit-to-Page off, and economy off. Record the actual driver quality and colour wording; no driver DPI is invented. Canon's documented printable-area and scaling references are linked in the guide.
