+- The public `validate_manifest` / `--verify` path parses `qa/visual_inspection.json`, requires its schema and passed status, requires exact top-level maps for every current sheet, and requires every per-sheet status/match/hash/legibility/label field to remain passed and current.
+- End-to-end copied-pack negatives change each of `n`, `c`, `m`, `block`, `dpi`, `strength`, and `epsilon`; mutate the hash-refreshed public fixture; alter a PDF while refreshing its ordinary manifest/artifact hashes but leaving visual QA stale; and replace the hash-refreshed QA schema or status. All are rejected through `validate_pack`.
+- `PRINTING.md` no longer duplicates contributor row numbers. The hash-bound evaluator label file remains the only transferable sheet-to-contributor mapping.
